# Built-in touchscreen and pen of the Lenovo Duet: the panel is mounted rotated (output transform
# 90) and the compositor does not rotate touch input, so rotate it with libinput's calibration
# matrix (90 degrees clockwise) and map it to the panel. The same rule as the Kick and Oscairn images.
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN}=="1", ENV{WL_OUTPUT}="DSI-1", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0 -1 1 1 0 0"
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ENV{ID_INPUT_TABLET}=="1", ENV{WL_OUTPUT}="DSI-1", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0 -1 1 1 0 0"
